  "term": "Alcohol Amnestic Disorder",
  "definition": "Alcohol amnestic disorder is a mental health condition linked to long-term alcohol misuse and poor nutrition. It mainly involves short-term memory loss, along with made-up or distorted memories and problems with attention.",
